    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the throne room is so quiet now. just the wind blowing through the cracks in the stone and the smell of smoke. i'm sitting here in the dirt, looking at my broken shield... everything i fought for is gone. my men, my family, the whole kingdom. it feels like the gods just turned their backs on me. there's nothing left to do but wait for the shadows to take me. the story is just... over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
